<h1 nodeId="b73c7250-f2c7-4f30-97a5-548c1a1249e7">1 核心概要 Executive Summary (BRT 8.17-8.23)</h1>
<h2 nodeId="5f67c28b-170a-4178-af25-bd437102a5a5">1.1 一周小结 Weekly Summary</h2>
<p nodeId="2698fee4-3f3a-4757-af4e-d43a385878fd">本周核心结论聚焦两项：①KRI层面，团队综合系数均值0.8391，CI均值1.000（10/12名BDM达1.0+）与MTD新签152家（含MH 14家）构成主要支撑；但8月营业率89.1%，较7月下降6.8pp，仍是当月最大经营风险，Management Score（权重10%）待完成评定。②订单渗透率专项层面，截至8/20总分680分，BD达标12/71（16.9%）、BDM达标0/12；距8/31收官仅剩11天，需集中推动13–14分边缘BD跨过15分线，并优先辅导6名接近BDM达标线的管理者，以提升项目整体达标产出。</p>
<p nodeId="afdc2669-eb41-42cd-ab35-d1d98275804f"><em>This week’s management summary centers on two areas: (1) KRI—team average coefficient is 0.8391. CI averages 1.000 (10/12 BDMs at 1.0+) and MTD new signs reached 152 (including 14 MH), providing the main support. However, August operation rate is 89.1%, down 6.8pp versus July, remaining the largest operating risk; Management Score (10% weight) is still pending. (2) Order-penetration initiative—as of Aug 20, total score is 680; 12/71 BDs (16.9%) qualify and 0/12 BDMs qualify. With 11 days to the Aug 31 close, focus on moving BDs at 13–14 points across the 15-point line and coaching the six managers close to the BDM threshold to improve overall qualification output.</em></p>
